    "Face swapping for photos and video that runs entirely on your own device — nothing is ever uploaded." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gesichtstausch für Fotos und Videos, der vollständig auf deinem eigenen Gerät läuft — nichts wird jemals hochgeladen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Intercambio de rostros en fotos y video que funciona por completo en tu propio dispositivo — nunca se sube nada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’échange de visages sur photo et vidéo, entièrement sur votre appareil — rien n’est jamais envoyé en ligne."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scambio di volti per foto e video che funziona interamente sul tuo dispositivo — niente viene mai caricato online."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写真と動画の顔の入れ替えが、すべて自分のデバイス上で完結します。アップロードされることは一切ありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사진과 동영상의 얼굴 바꾸기를 전부 내 기기에서 처리합니다. 업로드되는 것은 전혀 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Troca de rostos em fotos e vídeos que funciona inteiramente no seu próprio dispositivo — nada é enviado para lugar nenhum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片和视频换脸，全部在你自己的设备上完成，绝不会上传任何内容。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "照片和影片換臉，全部在你自己的裝置上完成，絕不會上傳任何內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Face swapping needs all three. Remove one and the app returns to its download screen until it is fetched again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für den Gesichtstausch werden alle drei benötigt. Entfernst du eines, kehrt die App zum Download-Bildschirm zurück, bis es wieder geladen ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Face swapping needs all three. Remove one and the app returns to its download screen until it is fetched again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El intercambio de rostros necesita los tres. Si eliminas uno, la app vuelve a su pantalla de descarga hasta que se descargue otra vez."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
