    "The app needs its AI models before it can run. This is a one‑time download — afterwards face swapping works entirely on this Mac, with no internet connection." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die App braucht ihre KI-Modelle, bevor sie laufen kann. Das ist ein einmaliger Download — danach funktioniert der Gesichtstausch vollständig auf diesem Mac, ganz ohne Internetverbindung."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The app needs its AI models before it can run. This is a one‑time download — afterwards face swapping works entirely on this Mac, with no internet connection."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La app necesita sus modelos de IA para poder funcionar. Es una descarga única — después, el intercambio de rostros funciona por completo en esta Mac, sin conexión a internet."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’app a besoin de ses modèles d’IA pour fonctionner. Il s’agit d’un téléchargement unique — ensuite, l’échange de visages fonctionne entièrement sur ce Mac, sans connexion à internet."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'app ha bisogno dei suoi modelli IA per poter funzionare. È un download una‑tantum — dopodiché lo scambio di volti funziona interamente su questo Mac, senza connessione a internet."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリの実行にはAIモデルが必要です。初回のみダウンロードし、その後の入れ替えはインターネット接続なしでこの Mac 上で行われます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱을 실행하려면 AI 모델이 필요합니다. 한 번만 다운로드하면 이후 얼굴 교체는 인터넷 연결 없이 이 Mac에서 완전히 실행됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O app precisa dos modelos de IA antes de funcionar. É um download único — depois disso, a troca de rostos funciona inteiramente neste Mac, sem conexão com a internet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用需要先下载 AI 模型才能运行。这是一次性下载，之后换脸完全在这台 Mac 上进行，无需网络连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
